+<!-- custom: file imported from C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Sid Meier's Civilization IV Beyond the Sword\Beyond the Sword\Assets\XML\Interface\CIV4WorldPickerInfos.xml as part of adding new world sizes in AdvCiv-SAs based on the XXL World Mod's approach with the help of GPT-Codex-5.2 thanks. -->
